    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The two reported transactions involved an amendment of an outstanding option, resulting in the deemed cancellation of the &quot;old&quot; option and the grant of a replacement option. The option was originally granted on November 5, 2025 and is partially vested.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">The transaction reported herein reflects a one-time stock option repricing (the &quot;Option Repricing&quot;) pursuant to which the exercise price of the reported option has been amended to reduce the exercise price to $7.63 per share. If the Reporting Person exercises this option prior to the earliest of: (i) November 13, 2027; and (ii) a Change in Control during the Reporting Person's Continuous Service, each as defined in the Issuer's 2025 Equity Incentive Plan (the &quot;2025 Plan&quot;), then the Reporting Person will be required to pay a premium exercise price equal to the original exercise price per share of such option.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">One third (1/3) of the shares subject to the option award vested on November 5, 2026 and the remaining shares subject to the option shall vest in twenty-four (24) equal monthly installments thereafter, subject to the Reporting Person's continuous service through such vesting date.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">The two reported transactions involved an amendment of an outstanding option, resulting in the deemed cancellation of the &quot;old&quot; option and the grant of a replacement option. The option was originally granted on June 2, 2026.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">The shares subject to the option award shall vest at the earlier of (i) June 2, 2027 and (ii) the date of the Issuer's next annual meeting of stockholders, subject to the Reporting Person's continuous service through such vesting date.</footnote>
